      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... everything feels so empty. even the small stuff, like eating or sleeping, it all feels pointless because he's not here to share it. i feel like i'm just going through the motions, but there's no soul behind it anymore. like i'm just a shell waiting to be filled, but nothing ever will be again.",
